                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Art and theme of being an undead monster fighting humans are fun. I got this because I wanted something Halloweeny to play. Unfortunately, gameplay is terrible. Plus, you are supposed to collect these blue gems, but you lose them every time you die. Dying frequently seems to be a main theme of the game, so this makes collecting them feel pointless. Dying often feels cheap, which wouldn't be so bad if you didn't lose your gems. If you've played literally every other platformer, give this one a try.",
